  "version": "1.0.0",
  "note": "SINGLE SOURCE OF TRUTH for VSBCloud role security. The app reads it (src/platform/privileges.ts) to decide what the UI offers; solution/security/apply-roles.mjs reads the same file to write the privileges into Dataverse. Client and server therefore agree by construction. Absent = none: a grant that is not written here is denied.",
