  "spellingConflictsNote": "Seven tables are declared twice in src/data/entities.ts with different plurals - the `...es` / `...ses` double-plural trap. Each is modelled once here, with the other spelling as an entitySetAlias so the app resolves privileges whichever spelling a repository happens to use. Six are open questions only the metadata endpoint can settle, so they are `pac code add-data-source` work. The seventh, vsb_substructuretypeinprojects, is already settled: entities.ts states outright that ES.substructureTypesInProjects is wrong and ES_PLANT is authoritative, so its alias exists only so a stale reference still resolves. scripts/check-matrix.mjs keeps all seven visible."
